<title>HONG KONG: Enlight Corp unit launches US$20 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Enlight Corp unit launches US$20 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Banque Paribas Taipei.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PERIDOT LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ENLIGHT CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$20 MLN   COUPON    6ML+115BP  MATURITY 3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCH   09.MAY.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 YR 2	  CALLS     YR 2	 REPLIES  END MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS ($)250K,500K</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	  SALE LMTS US/UK/TAIWAN/SING/HK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  TAIWAN	GOV LAW   ENGLISH    PAY DATE  --</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p> ALL-IN RETURN FOR TOP-TIER MANAGERS IS AROUND 145 BASIS POINTS</p>
<p> ARRANGER     BANQUE PARIBAS TAIPEI (BOOKS)</p>
<p> CO-ARRANGER  FUBON COMMERCIAL BANK</p>
<p> NOTES	  PUT WAIVER FEE 45 BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
